# A “Massive Multilingual” Language Model

We focus solely on Masked Language Modeling, which we believe captures a more natural kind of bilingual correlation from a purely monolingual objective than sentence-level cloze models like MBART. We also train decoder-only models at this scale, but those are just the GPT-J model from EleutherAI, which completely ignores the presence of multilingual text altogether (i.e. it is unpreconditioned at the architecture level for multilinguality) and the mGPT model from NVIDIA, which is trained at a smaller scale than we are able to achieve.

